e on Global Leaderboard**\nStay alive as long as you can to be on top of the leaderboard!\n\n** Collect Treasures and Gold **\nGrab all the loots, one they you\u2019ll be the richest pirate in the world!\n\n** Powerful Upgrades ** \nAll the gold you loot will Improve your offense and unlock mighty Powers!", "short_description": "You\u2019ve escaped the battle of the Great Pirate War, but the enemies are still after you. Get your cannon ready and defend your island!"}]}, "developer_name": "Tartine Studio", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/tartinestudio/policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://www.tartine-studio.com/pirate-shooter-terms", "publisher_name": "Tartine Studio", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.tartine-studio.com/pirate-shooter", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": null, "context_topics": [], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": ["SHOOTER", "ACTION", "ADVENTURE"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": null, "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["TOUCHPAD", "GEAR_VR_CONTROLLER"], "supported_player_modes": [], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "465477818589720"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974479_2238749289742188_4039589485472645120_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=JtLcsyCT2EgQ7kNvwHmbCSJ&_nc_oc=AdkBQN2Bb12RM3o4ic2Xvb2oA7Pcai6kWBW_BKwpVB30V5WhmKyP_QTvXIqafFv-xaI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AftwV9CyZeTKwXsRtduER2bvCs29U_cwGDk_iw1lwRGNBg&oe=69A4371F"}, "is_concept": false, "is_test": false, "is_trial_offer_valid": false, "display_name": "Pirate Shooter", "platform": "A